stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> QUEUED
  QUEUED --> READY
  READY --> RUNNING
  RUNNING --> WAITING_USER
  WAITING_USER --> RUNNING: approved / resumed
  RUNNING --> BLOCKED
  BLOCKED --> READY: dependency resolved
  RUNNING --> INTERRUPTED: process or device stopped
  INTERRUPTED --> UNCERTAIN: side effect may have occurred
  INTERRUPTED --> READY: safe read-only work only
  UNCERTAIN --> VERIFYING
  VERIFYING --> COMPLETED: postcondition or receipt proved
  VERIFYING --> NEEDS_REVIEW: outcome cannot be proved
  NEEDS_REVIEW --> RUNNING: explicit verified recovery decision
  RUNNING --> COMPLETED
  RUNNING --> FAILED
  RUNNING --> CANCELLED
  WAITING_USER --> CANCELLED
  BLOCKED --> CANCELLED
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
